Package: liblandlock-policy0
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sandboxer library leveraging Landlock - shared library
 Landlock Policy provides a C shared library for sandboxing processes
 using Landlock with JSON or TOML configuration files.
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

Package: liblandlock-policy-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: liblandlock-policy0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sandboxer library leveraging Landlock - development files
 Landlock Policy provides a C shared library for sandboxing processes
 using Landlock with JSON or TOML configuration files.
 .
 This package contains the C header, pkg-config file, and development
 symlink for building against liblandlock-policy.

Package: landlock-policy
Architecture: any
Section: utils
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Landlock policy development and inspection tool
 landlock-policy develops, inspects, and transforms Landlock policies.
 .
 This package contains the schema inspection tool.

Package: landlock-exec
Architecture: any
Section: utils
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Landlock policy enforcement and execution wrapper
 landlock-exec is a focused reference wrapper that applies Landlock restrictions
 defined in JSON or TOML policy files, then executes a given command.
 .
 It composes multiple policy files and supports reading from files, directories,
 or standard input.
